  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting the Accession of Remaining International Human Rights Treaties in Malaysia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this action is to promote and advocate for the accession of remaining international human rights treaties, and ultimately incorporation of human rights related treaties/declaration into national laws and policies in Malaysia. The specific objectives of the action are 2- fold: To highlight, analyse and harmonise the relationship between Malaysian National Law (Civil and Syariah Laws) and key human rights treatiesStrengthen the advocacy and outreach on key human rights conventions (such as UNCAT, CED), and declaration (UNDRIP) targeting key decision makers and influencers.</narrative>
  </description>
